# E10 Iterated Prisoner Dilemma with the first prisoner of the variant commented in its Program.cs: always confess, against tit for tat: a variant of the oracles, the original sources but its line (tests/tools/csharp-ref/ref/Oracles/PrisonerDilemmaConfess/).
# Sequential, so the C# fixes every line: the whole trace in order, the senders of the messages included.
ignore ^$
cover all
fact trace ^(.+)$
same trace seq
